{
  "id": "01_4901",
  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "Figure-rise Standard ベジータ (NEW SPEC Ver.)",
    "en": "Figure-rise Standard Vegeta (NEW SPEC Ver.)"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 2750,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2023年07月29日 (土)",
    "year": 2023,
    "month": 7,
    "day": 29
  },
  "targetAge": 15,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "可動域と造形美を極めた“NEW SPEC”シリーズ第２弾！『ドラゴンボールZ』よりベジータ(NEW SPEC Ver.)が登場！",
      "en": "The second installment of the “NEW SPEC” series with the ultimate in range of motion and beauty! Vegeta (NEW SPEC Ver.) appears from \"Dragon Ball Z\"!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• マッスルビルドシステムがパワーアップ！「マッスルビルドシステムPLUS」を新たに搭載。",
      "en": "• Muscle build system is powered up! Newly equipped with \"Muscle Build System PLUS\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 人体構造を徹底検証。筋肉の隆起から指先まで細部に宿るリアリティを追求。",
      "en": "• Thorough examination of human body structure. Pursuing the reality in every detail, from the bulges of the muscles to the tips of the fingers."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 進化した肩の引き出し構造により、可動域が向上。スーツに隠れている部分にもディテールを施し、筋肉を表現。",
      "en": "• Improved range of motion with improved shoulder drawer structure. The parts hidden in the suit are also detailed to express the muscles."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 可動によって生じる隙間を目立たせない関節構造。大胆なポージングでも身体のラインが崩れない。",
      "en": "• Joint structure that does not make the gaps caused by movement noticeable. Even in bold poses, the body line remains unchanged."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 成形色だけでカラーリングを表現。組み立てただけでカラフルな仕上がり。",
      "en": "• Express coloring only by molding color. Colorful finish just by assembly."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸・胴・腰のジョイント部可動域には、クリアランスを設けることで自然なポージングを実現。",
      "en": "• Clearance is provided in the range of motion of the chest, torso, and waist joints to achieve natural posing."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 特徴的な腕組みはパーツの差し替えで再現。立体物としての理想的な見え方を徹底追及。",
      "en": "• The characteristic folded arms can be reproduced by replacing parts. Thoroughly pursue the ideal way to view it as a three-dimensional object."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 豊富な表情・ハンドパーツ等の付属品で劇中の印象的なシーンを表現できる。",
      "en": "• You can express impressive scenes from the play with a wide variety of facial expressions, hand parts, and other accessories."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ディスプレイ用台座が付属。",
      "en": "• Display pedestal included."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "ja": "表情パーツ×4種",
      "en": "Facial expression parts x 4 types"
    },
    {
      "ja": "腕組み用パーツ×1",
      "en": "Arm parts x 1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ハンドパーツ（左右）×5種",
      "en": "Hand parts (left and right) x 5 types"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ディスプレイ用台座×1",
      "en": "Display pedestal x 1"
    }
  ],
